摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Organize unlimited conversation tabs into editor-style, drag-to-split groups for DeepSeek Harness Web.","id":"gh:1341725929","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-docking-layout","slug":"ai-eks/dsh-docking-layout","topics":["docking-layout","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","layout"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Organize unlimited conversation tabs into editor-style, drag-to-split groups for DeepSeek Harness We"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ganize unlimited conversation tabs into editor-style, drag-to-split groups for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @ai-eks/dsh-docking-layout"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness Web UI plugin for organizing unlimited conversation tabs into editor-style groups"},{"id":"p4s2","text":". Split freely, then close or move tabs whenever a pane becomes too small."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Two groups | Three groups |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Unlimited tabs and groups, with no fixed pane-size guard.\n- Drag a tab to another group to move it"},{"id":"p8s2","text":", or to an edge to split; toolbar buttons split right or down.\n- At widths up to 760 pixels, one ful"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"l-width group is shown at a time with a group switcher.\n- Switching to single-column mode or another"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" main panel hides the docked panes; returning restores the groups.\n- Closing a tab changes only the "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"browser layout and never deletes its DSH Session. Closing the final tab opens a blank Session, reusi"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"ng an existing blank Session when DSH selects one."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"From Git:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"From a local checkout:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Remove the plugin with:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Enable Docking Layout from the DSH sidebar footer. Open Sessions from the group menu or the DSH side"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"bar, then drag tabs or use the split buttons to arrange them."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Performance and limitations"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The iframe pool keeps every group's active tab plus the two most recently used inactive tabs mounted"},{"id":"p20s2","text":". Revisiting an evicted tab reloads its embedded client. Each shared panel keeps an iframe per works"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"pace visited through its selector, preserving that workspace's native tabs until page reload. More g"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"roups and workspaces therefore use more browser memory and DSH Web connections."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"A shared right sidebar keeps native file-preview tabs open independently of Session and group select"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ion. File links from any conversation open in that same sidebar; collapsing it preserves its content"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"s. The Files tab lists every Workspace as an independent root, loaded on expansion, so multiple proj"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ects can be browsed together. Session switches leave the file tree and open previews unchanged. File"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"-tree and preview state last for the current page and are reset on reload. The right-sidebar workspa"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ce selector explicitly chooses the owner for session-scoped tools such as terminals and Git; changin"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"g the active conversation leaves this selection unchanged. Switching the selector restores that work"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"space's native tabs. Archived Sessions and subagent routes use the native conversation view. Touch l"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"ayouts use split buttons and the group switcher instead of tab dragging."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"With `dsh-better-sidebar` installed, a shared bottom workbench spans the conversation area below all"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" groups. Its workspace selector is independent of both the right sidebar and the active conversation"},{"id":"p22s3","text":". Switching workspaces or collapsing the panel keeps its terminals and tabs mounted. Open it from th"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"e bottom-panel button beside the right-sidebar button in the outer tab bar; drag its top edge to res"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ize, or focus the separator and use the arrow keys. Fullscreen and single-column mode retain the sam"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"e workspace ownership. The panel is available only while the companion plugin is enabled."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Only layout preferences are stored locally. The plugin does not copy Session logs, prompts, approval"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"s, or files, and all embedded pages are same-origin. It adds no model-visible prompts, tools, messag"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"es, or Session events."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Requires DeepSeek Harness `^0.2.1-rc.2` and Cordis `^4.0.5`. For DSH 0.2.0, use plugin `0.2.0-rc.2`;"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" for DSH 0.1.7, use plugin `0.1.7-rc.1`; for DSH 0.1.2, use plugin `0.1.2-rc.1`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"For the optional shared bottom panel, use `dsh-better-sidebar@0.28.0` with DSH 0.2.1. Its bottom-pan"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"el integration has been checked against this plugin."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Only the outer page keeps the development hot-reload connection, preventing embedded clients from ex"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"hausting HTTP/1 connections. Refresh the page to apply changes to plugins used inside embedded clien"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"sting HTTP/1 connections. Refresh the page to apply changes to plugins used inside embedded clients."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
